# A Man-eating Mite (abyssea 177): a level 99 Warrior in Xarcabard by the Cavernous Maw with The Truth Beckons completed
# and Dawn of Death accepted (GMs), no Traverser Stone, 7 maw quests completed (A Goldstruck Gigas, To Paste a Peiste,
# Megadrile Menace, The Beast of Bastore, A Delectable Demon, A Fluttery Fiend, A Beaked Blusterer) and An Ulcerous
# Uragnite accepted (GMs; an accepted one does not count). The maw, no stone: no section: its own warp event 204
# (entranceMawOnTrigger), finished on option 0: no warp. Traverser Stone 2 (a GM, one stone: `>= 1`): 58 (a Progress),
# finished on option 0: begun. Back to available (a GM): the maw again with no other talk between: 58 again (an Event-
# rank 58 would alternate with the maw's own onTrigger: 204), finished on option 2: begun (any option). Accepted: the
# maw: no handler: 204. A zone-in, accepted with no Resheph title: nothing. The title (a GM): the zone-in plays 59 (left
# open); its update on option 0 and on option 2: nothing; on option 1: updateEvent(the key item for 7 completed: Ivory
# Abyssite of Prosperity); finished: Ivory Abyssite of Prosperity given, then completed. Completed (title, stone and
# Dawn of Death still held): a zone-in: nothing; the maw: 204.
lists Xarcabard/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger Xarcabard/onEventFinish/58 Xarcabard/onEventFinish/204 Xarcabard/onZoneIn/1 Xarcabard/onEventUpdate/59 Xarcabard/onEventFinish/59
char zone=Xarcabard pos=271.5,-9,-70 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.AGoldstruckGigas completed
quest Abyssea.ToPasteAPeiste completed
quest Abyssea.MegadrileMenace completed
quest Abyssea.TheBeastOfBastore completed
quest Abyssea.ADelectableDemon completed
quest Abyssea.AFlutteryFiend completed
quest Abyssea.ABeakedBlusterer completed
quest Abyssea.AnUlcerousUragnite accepted
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # no stone: no section: the maw's warp event 204
finish                                  # option 0: no warp
keyitem TraverserStone2                 # a GM: one stone
trigger Cavernous_Maw                   # available, one stone, Dawn of Death accepted: 58
